# Telos, the Ithorians (TSL, 203TEL, 204TEL): Residential 082 West's
# terminal, the Ithorian compound's receptionist, Chodo Habat (the
# Ithorians' side, DSimpson's light side: we will guard their new droid
# intelligence), and Batono's hiding place ([Persuade] for Grenn's sake,
# our word given). Starts from the Czerka offices' checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_lorso data/routes/tsl/telos_ithorians.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Working for the Ithorians" and the Batono
# bounty in "Entertainment Module 081" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit Czerka          # out of the Czerka offices, and left to 082 West
module 203tel
exit to_204TEL
module 204tel
say =Log out.        # 082 West's information terminal
use info_term
talk
say Moza sent me     # the receptionist: here to see Chodo Habat
use 204_Ith_Rec
talk
say Yes, I'll see it to you safely # Chodo: the droid intelligence to see
say I'll return with the droid intelligence # safely from Bay Two
use 204_Habat
talk
save telos_chodo
say Do you know anything about a man named Batono # Chodo again: Batono
say Are you sure? Lorso # hides in apartment C1 (the passkey), our word
say [Persuade]          # given to tell no one
say I give you my word
use 204_Habat
talk
save telos_batono
exit to_203TEL       # back to 082 East and apartment C1 (the passkey)
module 203tel
say You're Batono, right? # Batono: the light way, convinced to come
say Lieutenant Grenn sent me # forward, with us to the TSF
say It's the right thing
say If it's your safety
say The TSF can put you under
say I can protect you
say I was a Jedi
say Come with me
use d_apartmentc1
use 203_batono
talk
to tr_batonoambush   # Lorso's mercenaries on the way out: fought
talk
fight 30
talk                 # Batono to Grenn: the bounty and a bonus
module 202tel
