exit d_Docks         # Mission 1: the droid intelligence at Bay Two
module 201tel
say I'm helping the Ithorians, yes # two Czerka men in the hall want us
say It has nothing to do with money # to reconsider their offer: turned
say No, and if there's nothing else, I'll be going now # down (DSimpson)
to tr_czerkaintercept
talk
say =Chodo Habat sent me to help deliver the replacement restoration droid.
use 201_ith_door     # the Ithorian at the middle dock lets us in
talk
use TermAirlock2     # the console: the bay doors opened
talk
say Yes, I'll get the droid back to the Ithorians # into the bay: the
to tr_droidint       # thugs waiting for the droid, fought (DSimpson: 2
talk                 # melee, 3 blasters); a modified hold-out blaster on
fight 30             # one of them; the droid to be taken back to Chodo
talk
save telos_droid_saved
say Yes, follow me to the Ithorian Compound # the droid: led to Chodo
say I'll go speak with him # (the droid at work, our reward: Infiltrator
use DrdIth           # Gloves); Mission 2, Loppak Slusk of the Exchange
talk
module 204tel
talk
save telos_slusk_asked
say Transit to another module
say Entertainment Module 081 # the terminal's transit to 081, and the
use info_term        # cantina: Luxa, guarded by Gamorreans
talk
