say Why is that?     # thugs' modified hold-out blaster shown to Grenn
say Perhaps I could help you find the source # (200TEL_Sting=1 since the
say I'll see what I can do # Ithorian's [Awareness]); he asks us to find
use 202_Gren         # its seller
talk
until 200TEL_Sting=3
say What can you tell me about this blaster # Samhan, 081's only weapons
say I think there's something you're not telling me # merchant, sold it;
say I want to know who sold the weapon # his smuggling plan heard out
say Perhaps you should be more careful
say Do you know anything about the smuggling operation
say I'd like to help you with your smuggling operation
say What can I do for you?
say Yes, I've been there.
say Other uses?
say So I just need to walk in there and take a plant?
say What should I do then?
say I'll be back when I have them
use Samhan
talk
until 200TEL_Sting=7
say Samhan wants me to get three things for him # back to Grenn: his
say Leaves from the Ithorians' bachani plant # counter-plan, the goods
say I understand. Just make sure you're there # the TSF gives us
use 202_Gren
talk
say I've got the items you were looking for # Samhan takes the party to
